      "Negusa-Nagast": "Nigista-Nagast (or Itege)",
      "Ras": "Rasit",
      "Shum": "Shumit"
    },
    "government": "feudal (Ethiopian; the Negus/Negusa-Nagast over a hierarchy of Ras and Dejazmach; the church and the elder-councils are narrative flavor)",
